{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can purchase the full release version of the game. During the testing phase, a free Demo version is available through the Demo subpage on this official store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchasing the game grants access to 8 stages, featuring 4 types of enemies and 2 Boss battles. Players will also experience several CG cutscenes, such as dramatic encounters between the protagonist and the bosses. The game includes various beautiful environments, including starry skies, snowfall, and stunning Tyndall light effects in mountainous areas. The full gameplay time ranges from 1 to 3 hours, depending on your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a single-player action-adventure RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong> Players must rely on their skill and reflexes to defeat enemies and bosses. In addition, players will be able to explore stunning scenery hidden throughout combat zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls:</strong> Players use the keyboard to move, attack, dodge, block, and perform other actions to survive intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Developer:</strong> The developer is a PhD student at the Intelligent Instrumentation and Equipment Laboratory, College of Engineering, China Agricultural University, located in Haidian District, Beijing, China. A lifelong fan of games and passionate solo developer, the creator is currently handling all aspects of the project\u2014programming, art, music, narrative, and design. Although working alone is challenging, the developer is committed to continuously improving the game based on player feedback. Thank you all for your support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665980?t=1745539757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665980?t=1745539757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati